  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1253335,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Hap in 1 - Moai-ui bomul, David-2: A Double Dose of Sega Fun!\n\nPrepare for a unique and quirky gaming experience with *2 Hap in 1*, a delightful compilation for the Sega Master System! This unusual title cleverly combines two distinct games into a single cartridge: *Moai-ui bomul* (Island of the Moai) and *David-2*.\n\n*Moai-ui bomul* casts you as a Polynesian warrior tasked with rescuing captured islanders from the clutches of menacing Moai statues. Navigate treacherous terrain, solve puzzles, and battle enemies using a spear and your wits.  *David-2*, on the other hand, puts you in the sandals of the biblical hero David, facing off against a giant robot lion!  Employ slingshots and strategic positioning to defeat the mechanical beast and its robotic minions.\n\n*2 Hap in 1* offers a refreshing blend of action, puzzle-solving, and charming 8-bit graphics.  Experience two completely different adventures, each with its own unique challenges and gameplay mechanics, all within one cartridge. It's a truly original and entertaining package for Sega Master System enthusiasts!"
    },
